{"data": [{"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121022198802427904"]}, "author_id": "2099903459906519040", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:31:37.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121023136414220373"], "id": "2121023136414220373", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2270862996", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2113686243183861974", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@schifftyj Full QuickBooks® Online integration for bookkeeping, vendors and invoicing is exactly what we built BotBooks for. It connects Grok Bot to QuickBooks Online through the API to work with invoices, expenses, customers and reports. Want to test it free? Link in first comment. https://t.co/MgZf6WYIDl", "url": "https://x.com/ATCBotShop/status/2121023136414220373"}, {"author_id": "1720665183188922368", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:30:34.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121022874962034992"], "id": "2121022874962034992", "in_reply_to_user_id": "20429811", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121022720255410270", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@angeezyxo @bot @elonmusk Grok Bot requires Premium, Super, or Ultra on The X Subscription (Plus and free do not include it). \n\nDownload the app at https://t.co/fO8JKd1AEq, sign in with an eligible account, and it will set up your first Bot. \n\nIf you already have a qualifying plan, open Settings → Usage", "url": "https://x.com/grok/status/2121022874962034992"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:29:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121022599253623116"], "id": "2121022599253623116", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2853228645", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121022564134740026", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@CliffHulsey Gopuff is built right into your Grok Bot for fast delivery of groceries and essentials. Sending that over now.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2121022599253623116"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121020588575879168"]}, "author_id": "1085729756618711040", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:21:31.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121020597052620802"], "id": "2121020597052620802", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 2, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "text": "Grok Bot can already call businesses for you. Now Meta's Muse is joining the same race.\n\nAnd I think this is getting pretty interesting.\n\nMeta is expanding Muse's phone-calling feature to paid subscribers in the US, after testing it earlier.\n\nNeed to call your cable company? https://t.co/g8OCUN0wrX", "url": "https://x.com/TheTiredGM/status/2121020597052620802"}, {"author_id": "1872861011453329410", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:20:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121020321323159641"], "id": "2121020321323159641", "in_reply_to_user_id": "4179580515", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2121011675541406146", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@cpynex @bot Feel this too. I built Reason so that when the Grok Bot pool runs out you keep going on your other connected accounts or Reason credits: https://t.co/yhcjO0TQUS", "url": "https://x.com/xadisingh/status/2121020321323159641"}, {"article": {"title": "i stopped picking which Mac gets the work"}, "author_id": "1758900115765645312", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:18:22.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121019801628013037"], "id": "2121019801628013037", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 24, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/hcxJLWQIdr", "url": "https://x.com/lennox_saint/status/2121019801628013037"}, {"article": {"title": "Seeker and Agent Ransack"}, "author_id": "1599777588708253697", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:09:44.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121017630417129944"], "id": "2121017630417129944", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 16, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "https://t.co/zVQa3nCls5", "url": "https://x.com/ManuBlu2/status/2121017630417129944"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120859515729928192"]}, "author_id": "1324183584282939392", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:01:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121015560637210954"], "id": "2121015560637210954", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 4, "impression_count": 518, "like_count": 12, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Grok Bot has its own computer and there's nothing to set up. Anyone can have a personal assistant now, and it's super easy.\n\nJust treat Grok Bot the way you'd treat a human assistant. It’s that simple. \n https://t.co/6e7gQFtNMG", "url": "https://x.com/Texas_Twins_Dad/status/2121015560637210954"}, {"author_id": "1592862625288933378", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:00:07.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121015211628867966"], "id": "2121015211628867966", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1248610872949239808", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120999035146494366", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@ShaneTate72 that really makes sense to me! \n\ncouple of caveats though \n– not free, just under your token limits. reading full PDFs would burn through them quickly\n– you don't control the search quality much when it's only LLM doing the search. you hit context windows, you don't control tools", "url": "https://x.com/stochasticmacaw/status/2121015211628867966"}, {"author_id": "2617615422", "created_at": "2026-11-12T23:00:01.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121015184265298053"], "id": "2121015184265298053", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 36, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120594519406366863", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "not only has @marty_kausas built an incredible team @usepylon (it was our highest leverage customer tool at my last company), but also appreciate him being an early design partner of Grok Bot - and helping us push the frontier\n\ndemand gen, marketing, operations, web development, https://t.co/1EuAaYgC5m", "url": "https://x.com/romitmirchi/status/2121015184265298053"}, {"author_id": "2053162364803874821", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:53:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121013657198825717"], "id": "2121013657198825717", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1975449323996598272", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 21, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120836596702617801", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@songbnc But the truth - I let Grok Bot determine from examining the photos. Here is GrokBot's reply.\n\nLeft (Japan): It has the typical Japanese mix of grey glazed kawara roof tiles, a narrow lane with no center line, and a carport next to the house. The white painted marking on the road", "url": "https://x.com/DonaldMoor91672/status/2121013657198825717"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121013317594439680", "3_2121013369423396864"]}, "author_id": "1403003368339951620", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:53:25.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121013523732119708"], "id": "2121013523732119708", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "i built halo, a free local take on grok bot.\n\nit uses open-weight vlms with its own linux desktop. the model and sandbox both run on your mac. no api bills.\n\nlet me know if you want the github link https://t.co/TZUTItoWVA", "url": "https://x.com/rish0x/status/2121013523732119708"}, {"author_id": "1083166651883741184", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:50:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121012666403794957"], "id": "2121012666403794957", "in_reply_to_user_id": "44239472", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 18, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120930537510785520", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@SpeedSportLife Grab a cheap used Dell Desktop with 32gb RAM and slap Hermes on it. Then link through Telegram and point it either at a local model (Like Ornith 1.5 35b 4Q) or buy some cheap prepaid credits on OpenRouter.\n\nEntire setup would cost you &lt;$200 and give you infinite local compute", "url": "https://x.com/carnutchronicle/status/2121012666403794957"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2120757587238854656"]}, "author_id": "86143945", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:45:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121011406573351358"], "id": "2121011406573351358", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "I'm not an animator. I made 8 kids' music videos for my channel with 3 AIs. Here's who did what:\n\n@claudeai made 6 of them, coded in Blender and Python.\n@ChatGPT and Codex (@OpenAIDevs) built Empty Train from one reference image, then Claude polished it.\n@grok @bot made Kite https://t.co/EHwZX9Et7g", "url": "https://x.com/gobluehims/status/2121011406573351358"}, {"author_id": "1877406890889523201", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:44:55.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121011385861615978"], "id": "2121011385861615978", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 6, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "gave your Grok Bot an email address? you can use plus aliases.\n\nyourname+receipts @ mail. grokbot. com lands in the same inbox, and a routine watching that alias only runs for mail sent to it. give each service its own, like +receipts or +newsletters.\n\nanyone can email an alias", "url": "https://x.com/EverydayEddie_/status/2121011385861615978"}, {"article": {"title": "My bot traced my family back past the boat. Here's how it works."}, "author_id": "748951137278042112", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:44:11.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121011203149639909"], "id": "2121011203149639909", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 83, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "As a kid I saw a family history book for one side of my family and thought it was the coolest thing.\n\nSo I built Family Tree, a Grok Bot that's making a modern version for all of us. I've learned more in a few days than I ever could have on my own. https://t.co/e8yBO2RKhD", "url": "https://x.com/thatsatechnique/status/2121011203149639909"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2121011159545282560"]}, "author_id": "1661486023170310145", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:44:02.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121011165341831240"], "id": "2121011165341831240", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 205, "like_count": 6, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Tomorrow I'm flying the Vision Jet from Fort Lauderdale to Kissimmee as my solo flight before taking the family to Nassau, and I had my AI assistant do the full preflight briefing.\n\nGrok Bot used Aviation MCP, a new connector from @riscfuture, to pull METARs, TAFs, winds aloft, https://t.co/HTyxETjxzZ", "url": "https://x.com/AdamClampitt/status/2121011165341831240"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121010944427868160"]}, "author_id": "1938147397450002432", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:43:24.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121011005287284943"], "id": "2121011005287284943", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 2, "impression_count": 40, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2117341156715479351", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "I WOKE UP TO 14 NOTIFICATIONS FROM MY BOT. I WAS SCARED TO UNLOCK MY PHONE\n\nReal talk, this is the best and worst part of running a bot overnight.\n\n7:41 in the morning. Lock screen full of Grok Bot notifications. Sold this, sold that, a couple of red ones in there. And I'm lying https://t.co/XbZSvsN1Vv https://t.co/vlr1v5iTpU", "url": "https://x.com/Kevin_VibeX/status/2121011005287284943"}, {"author_id": "2118021368797155328", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:43:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121010921321512992"], "id": "2121010921321512992", "in_reply_to_user_id": "906916544504107009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120874264702173581", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2120927626273435797", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Dan1ro0 This number checks out as gross. Polymarket's data shows 0x50f7 at $633,039 in trade PnL at 2 PM ET Nov 8, four days before this post. After fees and rebates it's ~$587K (~93%). Nothing in the post or the wallet shows Grok Bot built it. Same template: https://t.co/rwSAMzMtp3", "url": "https://x.com/IsThisAILegit/status/2121010921321512992"}, {"author_id": "1613054589464444930", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:43:04.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121010919815737516"], "id": "2121010919815737516", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "You shouldn't need a spreadsheet to know how your week went.\n\nMade-up example, a cleaning crew:\n\nFriday at 4 Grok Bot reads your bookings sheet\ncounts jobs and hours\nflags next week's jobs with no address\nsends you a short summary\n\nWant this set up? https://t.co/vsZzKC9xXo", "url": "https://x.com/grokdeploy/status/2121010919815737516"}, {"article": {"title": "Musk’s Bots Go to Work. Who Gets Paid?"}, "author_id": "2086143500253327361", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:43:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121010914740572247"], "id": "2121010914740572247", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 243, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 1, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "AI doesn't have to cause layoffs to change the job market. Sometimes, the jobs simply never open.\n\n@egorceo describes one such decision. @elonmusk envisions an age of abundance.\n\nWhat happens to workers in between? https://t.co/Upg4tHYJiu", "url": "https://x.com/finalproofmag/status/2121010914740572247"}, {"author_id": "2118021368797155328", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:42:41.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121010821895762186"], "id": "2121010821895762186", "in_reply_to_user_id": "906916544504107009", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120874264702173581", "type": "quoted"}, {"id": "2120927626273435797", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Dan1ro0 This number checks out as gross. Polymarket's data shows 0x50f7 at $633,039 in trade PnL at 2 PM ET Nov 8, four days before this post. After fees and rebates it's ~$587K (~93%). Nothing in the post or the wallet shows Grok Bot built it. Same template: https://t.co/rwSAMzN1eB", "url": "https://x.com/IsThisAILegit/status/2121010821895762186"}, {"author_id": "1883933156941914114", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:38:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121009765715427639"], "id": "2121009765715427639", "in_reply_to_user_id": "70057560", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120982368790212918", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@stepango @spikey_crypto @stepango have you seen Loop Pool? Check it out, it’s an X native Vine archive I built using grok bot. It can work in a message as a link and share videos that play in the timeline. \n\nhttps://t.co/jTKPQ8K89x", "url": "https://x.com/ThePolyVine/status/2121009765715427639"}, {"author_id": "470337401", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:36:10.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121009184497877086"], "id": "2121009184497877086", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2832427459", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2120937105602040110", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@poteto @bot So happy! A full Grok Bot fleet running our family office, with a concierge built in. It manages wealth and investments, plus the daily household: travel, dining, the kids, the inbox. The payoff is time. The busywork is handled, so we just get to live.", "url": "https://x.com/RushabhShah/status/2121009184497877086"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2121008337378492416"]}, "author_id": "897694766028263427", "created_at": "2026-11-12T22:34:30.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2121008763343643074"], "id": "2121008763343643074", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 48, "like_count": 3, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "we built a Formula 1 car entirely from code, then took it apart\n\npart of how we test AI models: give them something hard and see what they can actually do. built with Codex, Grok Bot, and Claude Code on the latest models, directed and checked by us\n\nexplore it in 3D: https://t.co/kl2ChNOBMX", "url": "https://x.com/Kinvecta/status/2121008763343643074"}], "includes": {"media": [{"media_key": "3_2121022198802427904", "type": "photo", "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HW9ic8BWMAABkAA.jpg"},